    "body": "## Merge order\n\n- Based on `main`; no dependencies. Open PRs #415 to #421 do not change `sp-devonthink-insert-link`, so any order works.\n\n## Problem\n\n- `M-x sp-devonthink-insert-link` never offered a page.\n- Cause: the page was read by `sp-devonthink--read-page`, which asks only when a prefix argument is given (`C-u`). A plain `M-x` returned nil, so only a whole-record link could be inserted.\n\n## Change\n\n- `sp-devonthink-insert-link` now always asks `Page (empty = whole record):` after the citekey.\n- Accepts a number from 1; an empty answer links the whole record; anything else (text, 0) asks again.\n- `sp-devonthink-open-from-note` and `sp-devonthink-citar-open` keep the prefix-argument behaviour (opening is quick, a page is the exception).\n- Doc: `sp-devonthink.org` (tangled to `sp-devonthink.el`); 3 new ERT tests (17 pass); tangle check passes.\n\n## What was verified\n\n- [x] Tests exercise the interactive flow with stubbed prompts: plain call asks for the page, empty answer gives the whole-record link, bad input re-asks.\n- [ ] Not verified: real `citar-select-ref` followed by the page prompt in your Emacs, and that the link opens at the right page in DEVONthink (no DEVONthink or Emacs UI in the build environment).\n\n## Manual testing\n\n- [ ] In a note, `M-x sp-devonthink-insert-link`, pick `arthur-2004-value-negat`: a `Page (empty = whole record):` prompt appears.\n- [ ] Answer `12`: inserts `[[devonthink:UUID::12][arthur-2004-value-negat p. 12]]`.\n- [ ] Click that link: DEVONthink opens the PDF at page 12 (page 1 is the first page).\n- [ ] Run it again and press Enter on the prompt: inserts `[[devonthink:UUID][arthur-2004-value-negat]]`.\n- [ ] Answer `abc` or `0`: the prompt appears again.\n- [ ] `C-c k d l` (the key for this command) behaves the same.\n- [ ] `C-u M-x sp-devonthink-open-from-note` in a litnote still asks for a page and opens it.\n\n## Revert guide\n\n- `git revert` the single commit of this PR; nothing depends on it.\n- Reverting restores the prefix-only page prompt (a plain call links the whole record).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiDWYwkgX4eqm2SVoTC)_",
